  "primary_unique_mathematics": "Each nonwhite color has all four cubes determined from the front/top/right visible material cells. The remaining white cells are (0,1,0),(1,1,0),(1,1,1),(2,1,1). This is a planar offset pair (zigzag S) congruent to C. E is planar L with a straight run of three cubes; white has longest straight run two. A and B are nonplanar and D is a 2x2 square. Thus C remains unique; colors on boundaries do not change material fills.",
